## 🔴 Top 6 Systemic Patterns (Cross-Module)

Các patterns dưới đây xuất hiện **xuyên suốt nhiều modules**, cho thấy đây là **platform-level issues** cần giải quyết ở tầng design system, không phải fix từng màn hình.

### 1. OTP UX Gaps — 29 findings

| Affected modules | ~15+ modules |
|---|---|
| **What's missing** | Countdown timer, resend button, error state (red cells), auto-focus |
| **DDL spec violated** | `otp-input-1`: `canResend` + `timeLeft` states |
| **Risk** | User stuck if SMS delayed → cannot complete transaction → support call |
| **Fix scope** | **Platform component** — fix OTP bottom sheet component once → propagates to all flows |

### 2. PII / Account Number Masking — 23 findings

| Affected modules | Chuyển tiền, Tiết kiệm, Tra soát, Voice OTT, Tài khoản |
|---|---|
| **What's missing** | Account numbers displayed in full (e.g. `1212390002122`) |
| **Standard** | Mask: `1212***2122` with tap-to-reveal toggle |
| **Risk** | PII exposure on screenshots, screen-sharing, over-shoulder viewing |
| **Fix scope** | **Data formatting utility** — centralized masking function across all account display components |

### 3. Touch Target Violations — 16 findings

| Affected elements | Toggles (24px), calendar icons, close buttons, links |
|---|---|
| **Standard violated** | Fitts's Law: 44px minimum · WCAG 2.5.8 |
| **Risk** | Motor disability users excluded · Accidental mis-taps |
| **Fix scope** | **Design tokens** — `TOKEN:touch.target.min=44px` enforcement in DDL |

### 4. Loading / Processing Feedback Missing — 12 findings

| Affected flows | Submit OTP, search, save settings, fetch lists |
|---|---|
| **Standard violated** | Doherty Threshold (400ms), Nielsen #1 |
| **Risk** | Double-submit → duplicate API calls · User uncertainty |
| **Fix scope** | **Button component** — loading state variant in button/CTA component |

### 5. Destructive Actions Unprotected — 11 findings

| Examples | Xóa tài khoản, xóa danh bạ, huỷ dịch vụ, xóa tất cả thông báo |
|---|---|
| **What's missing** | Confirmation dialog · Destructive color (red) · Undo snackbar |
| **Standard violated** | Nielsen #5 — Error Prevention |
| **Fix scope** | **Dialog component** — destructive variant with red CTA + undo pattern |

### 6. Empty State Incomplete — 11 findings

| Current state | Text-only: "Không có kết quả" |
|---|---|
| **DDL spec requires** | Icon + title + description + optional CTA |
| **Standard violated** | Nielsen #6, DDL `empty-state-1` spec |
| **Fix scope** | **Empty state component** — standardize across all list/search views |

