## 🎯 Recommended Fix Priority

### Phase 1 — Platform Components (Week 1-2)
Fix **once**, propagates to **all modules**:
1. ✅ **OTP component** — timer + resend + error + auto-focus
2. ✅ **Account masking utility** — centralized PII formatting
3. ✅ **Button loading state** — disabled + spinner variant

### Phase 2 — Design Token Enforcement (Week 3)
4. ✅ **Touch target minimum** — 44px token enforcement
5. ✅ **Destructive dialog variant** — red CTA + undo snackbar
6. ✅ **Empty state component** — icon + title + description + CTA

### Phase 3 — Module-Specific Fixes (Week 4+)
7. Inline validation per module
8. Copy/content corrections (typos, ASCII Vietnamese)
9. Accessibility fixes (contrast, ARIA labels)

